<p>If you're not on the first page of Google, you're invisible to 95% of those potential customers. SEO — Search Engine Optimization — is the discipline of making sure your website earns those top spots. But SEO in India is not the same as SEO in the US or UK. Indian search behaviour, regional languages, mobile-first infrastructure, and competitive dynamics require a tailored playbook.</p>
